              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki ake airorie ninye ejo, “Oo tenaa artam etumi te ine?” Neng'amaaa ajoki, “Ore enkaraki lelo artam, maas ina.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.18.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
