          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejo Abraham, “Ing'ura ajo ayaua kewan airorie Olaitoriani. Oo tenaa tikitam etumi te ine?” Newaliki ninye ajoki, “Ore tenkaraki lelo tikitam maidaikie ninye.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.18.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
