              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki Abraham ajo, “Oi mincho Olaitoriani egoro, naa kairo ena ae nabo ake. Oo tenetumi tomon te ine.” Newaliki ninye ajoki, “Ore enkaraki e lelo tomon maidaikie nanu ninye.” ",
          "type": "text",
